  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_c075c6820ee14e19b2c1c5dbb0ebb351",
      "statement": "AgentRuntime.run() in src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py is the end-to-end execution pipeline: it prepares the input, runs the tool-calling cycle (or a single inference), applies reflection and guardrails, persists memory, and returns a result dict plus a runs.jsonl log entry.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py#L935-L1197",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f588fadfd38eef3587c12f45f65ad21ac95c48d2896ae382387a15caed4a2284:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_10f2d43be6c34a5d804c56f062a7db1e",
      "statement": "AgentRuntime is constructed per agent directory via from_agent_dir(), which loads agent.yaml (AgentSpec), runtime.yaml (flattened into RuntimeConfig, honouring AGENTFORGE_PROVIDER/AGENTFORGE_MODEL env overrides), and an optional tools.yaml list of ToolSpec.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py#L113-L135",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:60361000fda4f6e362dd31357fc9afa19bbb463f9bbc81b1469e0fad7e851225:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py#L55-L84",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8b0424f4b8dbc570e56cae34434ea810f586cbf946f4fcc2238594ad900b4c47:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2b932b8c26874337b39b0b9e33bd0e3b",
      "statement": "Before inference, run() injects every guardrails.must rule into the user input as a 'MANDATORY RULES FOR THIS TASK' block, executes any ToolSpec marked required (embedding the result in <tool_results> tags), and optionally triggers read_log_tail / extract_file_content keyword intent hooks.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py#L923-L973",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:90b90fab6783ebfcdf494eadc42b9a15ed80d1d6088df88855c956722a70c9b8:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py#L935-L952",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f24e6f551477737a543585014460f7e9c4029441c990f562e422c748be9baed3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6b1e1931bf8044bb9e375eb7a9f98a3c",
      "statement": "In workflow.mode=respond_or_tool, _run_tool_calling_cycle() iterates up to max_tool_cycles (default 3) inference rounds with the full tool schema; other modes make a single provider.generate() call without tools.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py#L274-L283",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d1661d2e0914289452fd34a4dff0045980fb12eeac5181516907d24bb5293a43:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py#L52-L52",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b1e7aa2216bcb4d9c4683f3a8e07afe5278dbd9819185647b771d0dea701cd3c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py#L991-L1008",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6139a9253b870189f0cba82a71bdc9bbf8e302315ad1dd8dea97f0645394c08b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c4afc4547b6a47199ba75c78cac47688",
      "statement": "The tool cycle has two pushback paths capped by a shared budget of 2: a generic redirect when the model answers with text and zero tools have been executed, and a mid-cycle redirect when filename-shaped quoted must-terms are still missing on disk, telling the model to call write_file instead of describing files as text.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py#L260-L261",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d0894d87105c485a523106c8a613c6716fd86cd397308db0876fd419a03e904d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py#L305-L371",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f596cf071ba9ed0472a33a34ddba1080f6dc0289f79f6290eb8ad6e0fa998a31:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/runtime/engine.py#L529-L554",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5afdfef0e1c10405a9e77c2324430449665d74e4e99ce206af9cbad8c47d21fd:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_98f7ade2acbb441fbf6c433bf95ad8c7",
      "statement": "A separate 1-attempt budget redirects when the provider sets metadata.loop_detected on the response (emitted by the llama.cpp provider), telling the model to stop planning and either call a tool or give a final answer.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/providers/llamacpp.py#L377-L392",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2465f7c7b506220faf1249363953c70606aaecc4cffbe3497a74be50eda5337d:"
        },
