    {
      "id": "claim_0978a02bb30545be944dfdc42901426d",
      "statement": "_build_tools_schema() converts each ToolSpec to OpenAI/Ollama function format, appending when_to_use/when_not_to_use as decision hints and parsing input_schema JSON into parameters; when workflow.agents declares workers it injects a synthetic run_agent tool listing all available agent_dirs.",
