      "id": "claim_4142a7c7f2754c7786f89afec4d42800",
      "statement": "must_not auto-correction: _apply_guardrails() checks the last write_file content when present (otherwise the chat output), asks the judge which rules are violated, re-generates with a correction prompt up to 2 retries, re-writes the corrected content to disk for write_file-based output, and returns any remaining violations into metadata.guardrail_violations.",
