      "id": "claim_bfa2c79e224c41c981155b6f1e59bd34",
      "statement": "The memory.feed_mem0 flag triggers mem0_hook.feed_async() after the run is logged — a daemon thread that builds a structured content string (agent tag, user input, per-tool 300-char result previews, agent output) and calls mem0.Memory.add() against a local mem0/Qdrant config, never blocking or raising.",
