      "id": "claim_dfd877fd753244feb0b090447f431a31",
      "statement": "run() returns a dict with agent_id, provider, input, output, a metadata block (workflow/channel/model, timestamp, latency_ms, tool_executed, tool_data, tool_calls_log, conversation_turn, guardrail_violations, plus any caller-supplied metadata), and a provider_response block; _log_run() appends a compact 500-char-preview entry to runs/runs.jsonl in the agent directory before returning.",
